    "notes": "Retained Q2927205 and OSM way 379073131 identify the structure. The November 9 cycleway and footway traces establish the signed frame. +X points southeast toward Islands Brygge. +Z points southwest along the harbour. The mapped 190.968 m envelope and separate footway and cycleway traces locate the closed crossing. Deck grades and visible support, fender and pivot proportions come from ordinary exterior photos and standard Terrarium terrain. Fender freeboard is fitted to the native harbour water in the review. The ferry probes measure rendered clearance in the closed pose. Physical-device timings and surveyed navigation clearance remain unmeasured."
  },
